            "value": "OpenBean 没有蓝牙权限"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "OpenBean keeps trying. If it doesn't connect in a minute, put the recorder back in its case and take it out again.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "OpenBean 会一直重试。一分钟后还连不上，就把录音豆放回充电盒再拿出来。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "OpenBean scans for a recorder again next time it connects.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "下次连接时 OpenBean 会重新扫描录音豆。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Optional. Whenever a transcript has one of these, it becomes the term. Chinese must match exactly; English ignores case, spaces and hyphens.": {
